---
import { buildDays } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="sec" id="build"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Seven days</span><h2>Watch it build, <em>day by day.</em></h2><p>Follow Muhammed Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury's 4-page CV as it becomes a 2-page CV and a live executive site. Tap any day, or press play and watch the seven days run.</p></div>
  <div class="bs-rail" id="bsRail" aria-label="The seven days">
    <div class="bs-line" aria-hidden="true"><i id="bsFill"></i></div>
    <ol>
      {buildDays.map((d, i) => <li><button type="button" data-d={i} aria-label={`Day ${i}: ${d.title}`}><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="n">Day {i}</span><span class="lb">{d.short}</span></button></li>)}
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="bs">
    <div class="bs-stage">
      <div class="bs-frame" id="bs" data-d="0" data-days={JSON.stringify(buildDays)}>
        <div class="bs-bar"><span class="bs-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="bs-url">mhchowdhury.netlify.app</span><span class="bs-flag bs-rev">In review</span><span class="bs-flag bs-livef">Live</span></div>
        <div class="bs-body">
          <div class="bs-cv">
            <span class="cvpg" id="bsTag">Base CV · page 1 of 4</span>
            <img class="pg pg1" src="/cv/base-1.webp" alt="Base CV, page 1 of 4" width="900" height="1165" />
            <img class="pg pg2" src="/cv/base-2.webp" alt="Base CV, page 2 of 4: major accomplishments" width="900" height="1165" />
            <img class="pg pg3" src="/cv/base-3.webp" alt="Base CV, page 3 of 4" width="900" height="1165" />
          </div>
          <div class="bs-vid">
            <video id="bsVid" muted playsinline preload="auto" poster="/video/mehdi-site-poster.webp" aria-label="Screen recording of the finished site, played in step with the build days"><source src="/video/mehdi-site.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video>
          </div>
          <div class="bs-final">
            <span class="fl">Final CV · 2 pages</span>
            <div class="fp"><img src="/cv/final-1.webp" alt="Final CV, page 1 of 2" width="900" height="1165" /><img src="/cv/final-2.webp" alt="Final CV, page 2 of 2" width="900" height="1165" /></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bs-info" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="bs-swap" id="bsSwap">
        <span class="bs-daynum" id="bsDay">Day 0</span>
        <span class="bs-phase" id="bsPhase">Free CV audit</span>
        <h3 id="bsTitle">Free CV audit</h3>
        <p id="bsText"></p>
        <p class="bs-gl">By the end of this day</p>
        <ul class="bs-got" id="bsGot"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bs-ctrl">
    <button type="button" class="bs-play" id="bsPlay" aria-label="Play the 7-day build">Play</button>
    <span class="bs-count" id="bsCount" aria-hidden="true">Day 0 of 7</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px;font:400 12px/1.5 var(--mono)">The pages are his real base and final CVs with personal details hidden, and the clip is his public live site.</p>
</div></section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/scrubber.js';
</script>
